{"4738170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Good Deed On Harris Avenue", "steam_appid": 4738170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Premise</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the southern end of Harris Avenue, there is a house. Tasked by a kindly neighbour, you are to deliver a letter to the resident of this house, but the resident won’t accept it. By understanding and trading with the litany of other street-dwellers, try your best to see the request lumped upon you through. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras/850d4b56d964368eec7550512db73b93.avif?t=1781910740\" alt=\"A picture of a wooden shack neighbouring a river\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras_big/850d4b56d964368eec7550512db73b93.webp?t=1781910740 width=1560 height=1174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Place</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing design inspiration from a selection of classic games, A Good Deed On Harris Avenue takes place in a single location. Explore and become intimate with this rich, hand-crafted pocket of the world, featuring 11 different houses, each boasting unique, explorable interiors created with a high level of care and intent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras/5db2e648abd90274ea3c26d419acc695.avif?t=1781910740\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras_big/5db2e648abd90274ea3c26d419acc695.webp?t=1781910740 width=1560 height=1171 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Point</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created to serve two desires: deliver an interesting and innovative puzzle experience, and to say something of note. A Good Deed On Harris Avenue accomplishes both of these goals in a single motion. Play it to find out how.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras/e0bd4f08be9f9a5ef0b20dfdabf2fa29.avif?t=1781910740\" alt=\"A picture of the player character sat on a bench\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras_big/e0bd4f08be9f9a5ef0b20dfdabf2fa29.webp?t=1781910740 width=1560 height=1174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>More About The Game</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about 1 hour long, and takes approximately 30 minutes more than that to get every achievement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a hand-crafted atmosphere designed to replicate the feeling of the hottest of hot summer days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The titular &quot;Avenue&quot; is an intimate, rich, environment perfect for getting absorbed in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features meditative, At-Your-Own-Pace gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals draw primarily from PSX/Dreamcast aesthetics, and combines aspects of their visual identities (resolution, aspect ratio, colour depth, etc.) and unifies them with a modern technical backend (high framerates, high quality audio, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs flawlessly on Steam Deck (a consistent 90fps on OLED, and 60fps on LCD).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738170/extras/435aea646678749064fcb3be4854caf1.avif?t=1781910740\" alt=\"A Dog\" width=238 heig